{"id":"f4f4d335b80a9d5ddbad395921a2b94dbc4e1dd6","axis":"silent","repo":"rustwasm/wasm-bindgen","sha":"f4f4d335b80a9d5ddbad395921a2b94dbc4e1dd6","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/main.yml","lines":["@@ -404,13 +404,16 @@ jobs:","             env:","               RUSTFLAGS: --cfg=web_sys_unstable_apis --cfg=wbg_next_unstable","           - name: \"js-sys\"","-            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval,temporal --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            node: '26'","           - name: \"js-sys (unstable)\"","-            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval,temporal --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            node: '26'","             env:","               RUSTFLAGS: --cfg=js_sys_unstable_apis","           - name: \"js-sys (next-unstable)\"","-            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            run: cargo test -p js-sys --features=unsafe-eval,temporal --target wasm32-unknown-unknown","+            node: '26'","             env:","               RUSTFLAGS: --cfg=js_sys_unstable_apis --cfg=wbg_next_unstable","           - name: \"wasm-bindgen-webidl\"","@@ -441,7 +444,7 @@ jobs:","         components: rustfmt","     - uses: actions/setup-node@v7","       with:","-        node-version: '20'","+        node-version: ${{ matrix.runs.node || '20' }}","     - run: ${{ matrix.runs.run }}"," ","   test_ui:"],"additions":7,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -194,6 +194,48 @@"," "," ### Changed"," ","+* Reworked the `js_sys::Temporal` bindings and `Date::to_temporal_instant`,","+  which stay behind `js_sys_unstable_apis` and now also need the new `temporal`","+  feature, against the final Stage 4","+  specification and reshaped them to the web-sys conventions. Inputs are","+  typed: `*Like` dictionaries such as `PlainDateLike` for `from`, calendar-free","+  `*Fields` dictionaries for `with`, and the bare form of a method takes the","+  type its argument converts to (`&str` time zones and calendars, `&PlainTime`,","+  `&Duration`, `&Self` for `until`/`since`/`equals`), while every other member","+  of a specification union gets a `_with_<type>` variant, so","+  `with_calendar_with_plain_date`, `add_with_duration_like`, `add_with_str`,","+  `equals_with_zoned_date_time`, `with_plain_time_with_str`,","+  `PlainYearMonth::from_with_plain_date` and the typed `relativeTo`, `calendar`,","+  `timeZone` and `plainTime` dictionary setters all exist; `compare` keeps","+  taking `&Self` only. Optional arguments expand to the plain method plus","+  `_with_options`/`_and_options`, `to_locale_string` takes no locale, a","+  `_with_str`/`_with_str_sequence` one or an `Option<&str>` with options, and `round`,","+  `total` and `get_time_zone_transition` take their options dictionary, with","+  `round_with_unit`, `total_with_unit` and","+  `get_time_zone_transition_with_direction` shortcuts. The option dictionaries","+  are `OverflowOptions`, `DifferenceOptions`, `RoundToOptions::new(unit)`,","+  `DurationTotalOptions::new(unit)`, `TimeZoneTransitionOptions::new(direction)`","+  and friends, the enums drop their `Temporal` prefix (`Overflow`, `Unit`,","+  `LargestUnit`, `TransitionDirection`, …). Bindings for the removed","+  `toPlainYearMonth`/`toPlainMonthDay` on `PlainDateTime` and `ZonedDateTime`,","+  `ZonedDateTime::with_plain_date` and `PlainTime::to_plain_date_time` are gone,","+  `offset_nanoseconds` returns `f64`, `era`, `era_year`, `week_of_year` and","+  `year_of_week` return `Option`s, `fractionalSecondDigits` is a `u8`,","+  `get_time_zone_transition` returns `Nullable<ZonedDateTime>`,","+  `to_js_string_with_options` and `to_locale_string` are fallible, constructors","+  expand their optional trailing fields (`PlainTime::new()`, `new_with_hour`, …,","+  `PlainDate::new_with_calendar`), and `catch` follows the specification:","+  `equals`, `compare`, the typed `from` forms (except `PlainYearMonth`'s date","+  conversions, which can leave the range) and the option-less","+  `Instant`/`PlainTime` arithmetic are infallible, while","+  `ZonedDateTime::start_of_day`, `hours_in_day` and","+  `PlainDate::to_plain_year_month` are fallible. Fallible bindings return","+  `Result<T, RangeError>`, or `Result<T, Error>` where a property bag, a","+  `relativeTo`/`plainTime` union or `Intl` options can also throw a `TypeError`. `PartialEq`/`Eq` on the","+  date-time types compare by the spec `equals()`, and `Instant` and `PlainTime`","+  are `Ord` through `compare()`.","+  [#5402](https://github.com/wasm-bindgen/wasm-bindgen/pull/5402)","+"," * The js-sys `JsFunction*` traits' associated types (`Ret`, `ArgN`, `BindN`)","   no longer carry a `JsGeneric` bound, so a `Function<fn(..)>` signature may","   name a converted carrier such as `Nullable<JsString>`, and"],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/js-sys/Cargo.toml","lines":["@@ -31,6 +31,9 @@ unsafe-eval = []"," # Pulls in `futures-util` directly so this keeps working under"," # `default-features = false`."," futures-core-03-stream = [\"dep:futures-util\", \"dep:futures-core\"]","+# Enables the `Temporal` bindings and `Date::to_temporal_instant`, which also","+# need `--cfg js_sys_unstable_apis` while they are unstable.","+temporal = []"," "," [dependencies]"," cfg-if = \"1.0.0\""],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/js-sys/src/Temporal.rs","lines":["@@ -5,31 +5,19 @@ use super::*;"," /// Used by `from()` and `with()` methods on date/time types."," #[wasm_bindgen]"," #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]","-pub enum TemporalOverflow {","+pub enum Overflow {","     /// Out-of-range values are clamped to the nearest in-range value.","     Constrain = \"constrain\",","     /// Out-of-range values will cause the function to throw a RangeError.","     Reject = \"reject\","," }"," ","-/// Overflow handling mode for Duration operations.","-///","-/// Used by `Duration.from()` and `Duration.with()`.","-#[wasm_bindgen]","-#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]","-pub enum DurationOverflow {","-    /// Out-of-range values are clamped to the nearest in-range value.","-    Constrain = \"constrain\",","-    /// Out-of-range values are resolved by balancing them with the next highest unit.","-    Balance = \"balance\",","-}","-"," /// Disambiguation mode for handling ambiguous times during DST transitions."," ///"," /// Used when converting `PlainDateTime` to `Instant` or `ZonedDateTime`."," #[wasm_bindgen]"," #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]","-pub enum TemporalDisambiguation {","+pub enum Disambiguation {","     /// Equivalent to `'earlier'` for backward transitions and `'later'` for forward transitions.","     /// This matches the behavior of legacy `Date` and libraries like moment.js.","     Compatible = \"compatible\",","@@ -46,7 +34,7 @@ pub enum TemporalDisambiguation {"," /// Controls how to handle time zone offset changes when parsing or converting dates."," #[wasm_bindgen]"," #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]","-pub enum TemporalOffsetOption {","+pub enum OffsetOption {","     /// Always use the offset to calculate the instant.","     Use = \"use\",","     /// Use the offset if it's valid for the date/time, otherwise use the time zone.","@@ -57,122 +45,41 @@ pub enum TemporalOffsetOption {","     Reject = \"reject\","," }"," ","-/// Temporal unit for date operations (singular forms).","-#[wasm_bindgen]","-#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]","-pub enum TemporalUnit {","-    Year = \"year\",","-    Month = \"month\",","-    Week = \"week\",","-    Day = \"day\",","-    Hour = \"hour\",","-    Minute = \"minute\",","-    Second = \"second\",","-    Millisecond = \"millisecond\",","-    Microsecond = \"microsecond